This grant does not relicense third-party anatomical atlases, templates, images,
streamlines, article figures, or publications. See public/data/licenses/NOTICE-DATA.md
and the individual notices linked there. In particular, some distributed FSL atlas
and template files carry non-commercial conditions. CC BY-SA datasets retain their
own permission for commercial reuse subject to the applicable license; the FSL
restriction is not added to those separately licensed datasets.

Source article figures are linked, not republished. PAM50 data and precomputed
PAM50 meshes are not part of the public package; optional client-side loading
accesses the declared official source directly.
